{
  "Npcs.Holli.Desc": "Marae's offshoot, Holli stands rooted in front of you. Solid black eyes with golden pupils stare out at you. Her normally-nude body is concealed inside her tree, though occasionally she will flash you the devilish grin of a sadistic temptress and the bark will split to reveal a pale, jiggling bit of flesh. A pair of gnarled oak horns sprout from her forehead; leaves and flowers alternately bloom and wither on them as her face contorts with emotion."
  "Npcs.Holli.Name": "Holli"
}
